  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2024-01-24T12:06:07-05:00\" title=\"Wednesday, January 24, 2024, 12:06 pm\">January 24, 2024</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6710\" src=\"/media/archive/c054bca40cb4b247e3700990ddf8cc72a5168684a66eae054f0e544a139220da.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" />Featured demonstration artist at the Guild’s January General Meeting was  Victoria Templeton who demonstrated her unique approach to Acrylic Painting.  Victoria is offering a class at the Cape Cod Arts Center, Feb. 21 – Mar. 27 *5:30pm Oil/Acrylic Beginners – Advanced Beginners Painting. More information at: <a href=\"https://capecodartcenter.org/classes-workshops/one-on-one-mentoringmentor-varies/\">Cape Cod Arts Center Link</a>.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
